      <tei:div type="colophon" subtype="notes">
        <tei:p>This prayer for the evening of Shabbat is an adaptation of Psalms 92 (the Song for the Sabbath Day), a poetic rendering by Rabbi Brant Rosen for his congregation Tzedek Chicago. It was first published on his blog on 3 June 2021 in a post, “Judaism Beyond Zionism: Toward a New Jewish Liturgy.”</tei:p>
